                  }}
                ></span>
                <p className="mb-1">
                  <strong>Aug 13, 2026</strong>
                </p>
                <p>
                  A developer on Google's forum:{" "}
                  <em>
                    "15 months ago you announced SignGemma as 'an open model coming to the
                    Gemma family later this year.' And yesterday you shipped SL2T on Pixel 11: a
