                  </em>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p className="pt-4">
              The <strong>AISLAC joint impact report</strong> — co-signed by the National
              Association of the Deaf (NAD), the World Federation of the Deaf (WFD), RIT/National
              Technical Institute for the Deaf (NTID), and the Deaf Professional Association of
              North America (DPAN) — still lists open-weights SignGemma as{" "}
              <em>"exploring… in consultation with the AISLAC."</em>
            </p>
            <p>That is not a timeline.</p>

            <p>
              <strong>Claim discipline (what I can and can't say):</strong>
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                I can say Google stated <strong>no hardware requirement</strong> — and their own
                architecture contains none.
              </li>
