                I can say it <strong>already runs on Snapdragon 8 Gen 2</strong> — proven, not
                promised.
              </li>
              <li>
                I <em>cannot</em> say Google "promised to bring it to other phones" — "more
                devices coming soon" is deliberately ambiguous (it could mean more Pixels).
              </li>
              <li>
                I <em>cannot</em> say it's "exclusive to Pixel 11" — Google never said that. The
                problem is the <strong>silence + client-side gating</strong>, not a stated
